# ── Local development ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The browser talks to the backend (../backend, `pnpm dev`) directly.
PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8787

# ── Production (set these in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables) ──
# PUBLIC_API_URL=https://www.pavlotishynin.com
#   The site itself: /api/* is proxied to the Worker (src/pages/api/[...path].ts).
# AQUARIUM_API_ORIGIN=https://aquarium-api.tishyninpavlo.workers.dev
#   The Worker. Used by the proxy and by server-side calls; never exposed to the browser.
